00:00:14.274 --> 00:00:16.002
The study of handwriting can be used

00:00:16.002 --> 00:00:19.056
to get a better idea of
somebody's personality

00:00:19.056 --> 00:00:20.393
and who they are as a person

00:00:20.393 --> 00:00:23.286
